  <data name="en_spotpoint39858_description"><![CDATA[<p dir="ltr" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">PONTO DE LUMINÁRIA DE SOBREPOR</span></p><ul style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;"><li><span style="line-height: 1.295;">Só instalar lâmpadas compatíveis com a tensão do projeto que é 220volts;</span></li><li><span style="line-height: 1.295;">Na instalação das luminárias utilizar somente as pontas dos fios branco e azul claro (retorno e neutro) que são deixadas para este fim;</span></li><li><span style="line-height: 1.295;">Para a fixação de objetos no forro de gesso (ex.: luminárias) atentar-se para a carga de uso máxima de 3kg. Usar quantidade e tipo de bucha e parafusos conforme superfície e carga.</span></li></ul><p dir="ltr" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="line-height: 1.295; white-space: pre-wrap;"></span><font face="verdana, sans-serif" size="1" style="line-height: normal; text-align: start;"><span style="line-height: 12.95px; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></font></p><p dir="ltr" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="line-height: normal; text-align: start;"><span id="docs-internal-guid-92fe86fe-c70e-354e-175d-5a6e4ff5b1e1" style="font-weight: normal;"></span></span><span style="line-height: normal; text-align: start;"></span><span style="line-height: normal; text-align: start;"></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><b>Manual de Uso, Operação e Manutenção. Itens:</b></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">"2.4 Colocação de acessórios em paredes, pisos e tetos".</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"></p><p dir="ltr" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"></p><p dir="ltr" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"></p><p dir="ltr" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"></p><p dir="ltr" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">"4.4.6 Instalações elétricas".</span></p>]]></data>

